      "id": "4a0c589b3080",
      "source": "Note",
      "target": "备注",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "71fdb2b16825",
      "source": "Notes are texts that users can place around in the node graph.\nThis can be useful to provide information about your project for other users or as a memory aid.",
      "target": "备注是用户可以放置在节点图中的文本。\n它可用于向其他用户说明项目，也可作为备忘。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "37e6a7fa7b37",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "d67ef0432c65",
      "source": "To create a note press ",
      "target": "若要创建备注，请按 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6ebc8e020ca",
      "source": "You can also ",
      "target": "你也可以",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "14c840100f4b",
      "source": " click in the node graph and select ",
      "target": " 在节点图中右键单击并选择 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "280036272643",
      "source": "Create Note",
      "target": "Create Note",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4827ea30ef4",
      "source": " from the context menu.",
      "target": "（位于上下文菜单）。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c8a0e0416dc",
      "source": "A crosshair will appear which you can use to specify the note text area by drawing a box in the nodegraph with ",
      "target": "随后会出现一个十字光标，你可以在节点图中用它框出备注文本区域：使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a09be8018f0",
      "source": " click and drag.",
      "target": " 点击并拖动。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "98ef06350fa4",
      "source": "You can also ",
      "target": "你也可以",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "027cbda700dd",
      "source": " click once to start typing right away if you want to specify your note size later.",
      "target": " 单击一次即可立即开始输入，稍后再指定备注大小。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "58101c0fec1a",
      "source": "Once the note text area is specified the ",
      "target": "指定备注文本区域后，",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a228fd3db767",
      "source": "Edit Note",
      "target": "Edit Note",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0cbffc5707f",
      "source": " window will pop up.",
      "target": " 窗口会弹出。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b92fe27480f",
      "source": "Here, you can write your note in the text field.",
      "target": "你可以在这个文本字段中写备注。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "154a82bae2bd",
      "source": "When finished writing, you can click on the ",
      "target": "写完后，可以点击 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "adb59e0c9683",
      "source": " icon in the top right corner or outside of the ",
      "target": " 图标（位于右上角），或点击 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "098e86bd4fa5",
      "source": "Edit Note",
      "target": "Edit Note",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0e1e49808eb",
      "source": " window to finish the note.",
      "target": " 窗口外部来完成备注。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce5eaca23299",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "18c9b7e93702",
      "source": "The note text is aligned to the left and wraps within the note text area.",
      "target": "备注文本会左对齐，并在备注文本区域内自动换行。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "3681cb3c4df9",
      "source": "The note text area can be edited by ",
      "target": "备注文本区域可以通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "519cae13e0b3",
      "source": " clicking and dragging one of the node corners.",
      "target": " 点击并拖动某个节点角来编辑。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5de2a4f1f15",
      "source": "The note itself can be moved around in the node graph by ",
      "target": "备注本身可以通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "39bfb9458838",
      "source": " clicking and dragging.",
      "target": " 点击并拖动，在节点图中移动。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "26c0919bc3fb",
      "source": "The note text can be edited, and the note itself can be cut, copied, or deleted using the ",
      "target": "可以编辑备注文本，也可以使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e04a3ed63925",
      "source": " right-click-menu.",
      "target": " 右键菜单剪切、复制或删除备注本身。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
